  "attribution": "來源：《焦氏易林》，易學網《焦氏易林［四庫全書版］》（依據版本：《欽定四庫全書》子部術數類），https://www.eee-learning.com/book/giauii 。依來源要求標示出處及原網頁連結；本站僅整理林辭原文，並記錄收錄、標點及文字整理修改。",
  "entryCount": 64,
  "missingTargets": [],
  "entries": [
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 53,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 53,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 53,
      "hexagramName": "漸",
      "poemText": "別離分散，長子從軍。稚叔就賊，寡老獨安。莫為種瓜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:166810f3ac0b5193d732e71920d178ca39b944f488a4772584690d1839fad13d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:53f59983cca487e50716f4d50d54222071915c9eed24f435111ee78b993a5062"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 1,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 1,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 1,
      "hexagramName": "乾",
      "poemText": "旦種穀豆，暮成藿羹。心之所願，志快意愜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:eb0d6e112f11a377e83e966e39ae1ec88aeda648df2cd012b0b07da5d455dd99",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:10dc7ec265e4a9b921452a1f393370039c56180b6cfa47e567e49e78f2d93423"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 2,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 2,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 2,
      "hexagramName": "坤",
      "poemText": "牡飛門啟，憂患大解，不為身禍。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d35598c497a301cebe4224d95a817fe427f07d32aeb5bb2298f1d0a77eb95ddb",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2cd2311af404f615f367a39979298d903e6357bf38cc0a36a9b682459405295c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 3,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 3,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 3,
      "hexagramName": "屯",
      "poemText": "東山西山，各自止安。雖相登望，竟未同堂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a6c9fbdd5f5914e1f0448c5a7e847771bb038105f4115c6bfdc73530b0714349",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:341e53514f4861bb880560f0915cada6f03466bcdf6f9d174c1c5c61d7227853"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 4,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 4,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 4,
      "hexagramName": "蒙",
      "poemText": "眾鳥所翔，中有大怪。九身無頭，魂驚魄去。不可以居。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:98df44657cba37e0b8955af224a59f130922d5916a1b0ea3671bb5d10ad39191",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d783ce601af8c94945e8e8104a2638add2114f726d118224ab4630b4cfa1dd86"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 5,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 5,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 5,
      "hexagramName": "需",
      "poemText": "交侵如亂，民無聊賴。追我濟西，狄人便殫。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9f0095b8b6717b2e5cea3e1588ddf4b4142caad271a307789e26ff7681dff5c1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8f3d549726e427e9b2517988b385dc54e36eb3897f56b4458f20ce539f2dc46d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 6,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 6,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 6,
      "hexagramName": "訟",
      "poemText": "麟鳳所翔，國無咎殃。賈市十倍，復歸惠鄉。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a91a9bda29149571e71dfc01a27d8fbecadae2f74ddb7fe38532875f35211a54",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5c88fcfdd2df26ea704f517889a9197ffeee37acf4f195167b816b460edc1c3b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 7,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 7,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 7,
      "hexagramName": "師",
      "poemText": "鑿井求玉，非卞氏宅。身困名辱，勞無所得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f535e8d343fa860eee146506e2e59039c802378e19dafd4366feeee0c1aed163",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3c3df97a67ff553b3cacf049f0f4b906e25e9e579a00650092ae588a51c499b6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 8,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 8,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 8,
      "hexagramName": "比",
      "poemText": "文山鴻豹，肥腯多脂。王孫獲願，載福巍巍。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:10dfe69c5d1c4de1361c50f29b78628cfcd69a59c3895d1bfc13e2f6eda7ae29",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4ca76347f78fd7521ca39b615eb1eb5fcd91c191d9b6b0c4380e831bb84c7274"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 9,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 9,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 9,
      "hexagramName": "小畜",
      "poemText": "周成之隆，刑措除凶。太宰費祐，君子作仁。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:390a169518e574ce507fb52015af4640dec11d4b10c59c359009c0a43c335f90",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b3f9dbf8833e2c0d2682d777dce4927f85ac9ada345503335d2a0497ea1c7f4d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 10,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 10,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 10,
      "hexagramName": "履",
      "poemText": "珪璧琮璋，執贄見王。百里甯戚，應聘齊秦。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:52827ff4e2b8bf766c861cf14c70fc638b74cc49e7178260888ea65ca72396fc",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d475a6c5b335f491d2294ef7a40d9685b59536c3d13c6d3ef039e0037e86a673"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 11,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 11,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 11,
      "hexagramName": "泰",
      "poemText": "穿空漏敝，破壞殘缺。陶弗能治，瓦甓不鑿。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4139b1525f924ef4e15df5206edbe648f5145c8a362617fccb03594102fea38c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6a03ba8c541f204e2969b8c6e2659d00b69ef0a9e8f2950e8c85f4471504c7bb"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 12,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 12,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 12,
      "hexagramName": "否",
      "poemText": "鴻飛循陸，公出不復，伯氏客宿。損之蹇）",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5480c27dcba4a08be36f9b45fec699c3732bc364a36af1bff0830c52e961b570",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:27c225b90a05a338f937194f0b74f7cbdbe33e3cfee0df929b04026cee76d3f1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 13,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 13,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 13,
      "hexagramName": "同人",
      "poemText": "蝦蟆群聚，從天請雨。雲雷連集，應時輒下。得其所願。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d18f148c5d4a0c7ef301624031415a090866373b04d3ce5e3d4e7cf248c02da3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4cc8d44e797ed55f3818cc081cdc1d3c183edd01a7d64795f3fc72cc7ba1ab40"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 14,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 14,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 14,
      "hexagramName": "大有",
      "poemText": "先弱無子，不能自理。為民雖憂，終不離咎。管子治國，侯伯賓服。乘輿八百，尊我恒德。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3a23017c4275afbe94c2be77c10174a2626d0752b335067bdee89c620adb6c83",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:34f0ccc591d462b27953f41e0c573f60e81129e99e235a47f8e907d080f6e862"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 15,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 15,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 15,
      "hexagramName": "謙",
      "poemText": "搖梅折枝，與母別離，絕不相知。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2e53499681ecb94d55a35859eebc5ec61c6174856d635dc1a2a34eb029b3a2a7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ab5eb8796775c854a7a7aadb85e61af59af55767c4f4fd08d3b4882d3f06b8da"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 16,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 16,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 16,
      "hexagramName": "豫",
      "poemText": "盛中不絕，衰老復拙。盈滿減虧，瘯蠡腯肥。鄭昭失國，重耳興起。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b45eb8799c75001e696b38fbb855590d6b6847d7537282e4b03c881cd589122c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7a12ab42469dbe742becd6d6ea9bd5732ff78847008e64c05eab064cde5a9e89"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 17,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 17,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 17,
      "hexagramName": "隨",
      "poemText": "聞虎入邑，心欲逃匿。走據陽德，不見霍叔。絕無憂慝。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:141b14cd16e05552be528788b3a9119cd12163eed1dc47b38238b39b925801d5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:33db9761cfc144f51f9ff3905945128d8636c057fd288716fb55b61eb1f379f8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 18,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 18,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 18,
      "hexagramName": "蠱",
      "poemText": "隨時逐便，不失利門。多獲得福，富於封君。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c81c798107d72ee29253b92a2bcbe3835f258061454abca497845340aff7c202",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:46faeec6421352c98c919af8626a221b6661b337a49356495246548164c15e80"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 19,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 19,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 19,
      "hexagramName": "臨",
      "poemText": "禹作神鼎，伯益衒指。斧斤既折，憧立獨倚。賣市不售，枯槁為福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1a76ad9b006f3182bfc28400708f8d994832b6d4826b293ca50bae69d0e6371d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:12274900fa0ff1243ade6295f5185561781533986f0875b15fa53b8d10295baa"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 20,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 20,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 20,
      "hexagramName": "觀",
      "poemText": "春鴻飛東，以馬貨金。利得十倍，重載歸鄉。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:02d88369e1001d580596ee5f5a355782afd5314978caf62523b6b501db20438b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:65b6b68871bf82ceee1c0035f1363d08c270af01c413728865f37b0b16472d8d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 21,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 21,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 21,
      "hexagramName": "噬嗑",
      "poemText": "金齒銕牙，壽考宜家。年歲有餘，貪利者得。雖憂無咎。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:34f8df208c4bc0b061f72d04ae6f19598bb45a513a074e6097f5086ee256cac5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5eb60bfa8243f88bc5707cf90d88808226e6b6645cd254876fd40c0e65c462a6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 22,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 22,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 22,
      "hexagramName": "賁",
      "poemText": "膏澤沐浴，洗去污辱。振除災咎，更與壽福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6964d43b78d98dc41e440c42c2fdc7629900eb01c2d1095b57ac4dda97a75074",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a5c3103a3edd456ec7fb9e326b3e6b21e125d79558beab145d3d3f5be1098074"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 23,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 23,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 23,
      "hexagramName": "剝",
      "poemText": "履階登墀，高升峻巍。福祿洋溢，依天之威。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:64fa88c740cb897d85c19ef633cdb94966ea80709574a12786d7fa201f845c79",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4ddb53df01a83e075706db1eb8cd172c42196a6bb46b9b15dc1e3381d197a657"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 24,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 24,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 24,
      "hexagramName": "復",
      "poemText": "坤厚地德，庶物蕃息。平康正直，以綏大福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4455862c9895f8d18e7f5469847de8fea7f6885e955aa16019dbafdac22093e0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:329cd9f632c3b1949448533e3263235ca804b02413ad69cac4829c4a9b827b30"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 25,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 25,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 25,
      "hexagramName": "无妄",
      "poemText": "絕域異路，多所畏惡。使我驚惶，思吾故處。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d23f0d583fc7c1e55ccf7036a14efde8bd2448a738e286bf6d53d26e4855befd",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b594959fffe3436373588a58f98485428214f4b115e9e7fcb881382b9ceddfbd"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 26,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 26,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 26,
      "hexagramName": "大畜",
      "poemText": "襁褓孩幼，冠帶成家。出門如賓，父母何憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3ac5c0adcd5c8d3326226cff3e89da7b57c9f53920476b5f8998c7965fbe8546",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:55aa5095cae81569f902cd4dca0468447c8f8f9d138bdf908c92209c4fc5a675"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 27,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 27,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 27,
      "hexagramName": "頤",
      "poemText": "一尋百節，綢繆相結。其指詰屈，不能解脫。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:da4cb883d73df9992cf321010a6014dda50d0a1b76f82c40f39fb1efcc15fbe6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:fba255907f60023970663c35331e3095dc6cf9d59650eb402f2a4f85103cc1bd"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 28,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 28,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 28,
      "hexagramName": "大過",
      "poemText": "鷹鸇獵食，雉兔困極。逃走見尾，為人所賊。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:40f3a5c3bcaa6db2a45429babe94cb1497e1a096494ccbcf8a42b7d376a6df44",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f8e9d5bbecb6aedc1b5940f817ab3c7453edd7bc919c77e553604cb20ef8e5c1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 29,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 29,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 29,
      "hexagramName": "坎",
      "poemText": "危坐至暮，請求不得。膏澤不降，政戾民忒。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:918844a2665500e8017e94b20e92c7154a8aed6a7d45232d3ae411892a5012ee",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8200b9e50bb983af57e9468fda7a807c9b62322d01aad0879b60362a5bf74c8b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 30,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 30,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 30,
      "hexagramName": "離",
      "poemText": "剛柔相呼，二姓為家。霜降既同，惠我以仁。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ba94ec671cb03e85bb3c07a5b81aa5f9b3be72ccb56b8c3b4c5d5a45571bdf8e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d0e7bee824993c1d1d4f602f34c067bf30ead539dcd1e89621392e89cdb579e9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 31,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 31,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 31,
      "hexagramName": "咸",
      "poemText": "慈母念子，饗賜德士。蠻夷來服，國人懽喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d84e145894a0cfdb57ee84c1c61a55ccc84ce0e1e298a9a8d6d37d7d6e7052a7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ae8095c2256d303b082c2c5e264c3b1ea723be9abd085f2e12427251b124d2b6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 32,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 32,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 32,
      "hexagramName": "恒",
      "poemText": "良夫孔姬，負悝登臺。欒季不扶，衛輒走逃。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8847693b9648f3160346b7a84de8f0ac11b471b19c5fb3bad1aec135a574c63d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:30538e4f2b85275aeaa375b176268ea61bc7da6c7f3ea4d695991256ac347fc7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 33,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 33,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 33,
      "hexagramName": "遯",
      "poemText": "子長忠直，季氏為賊。禍及無嗣，司馬失福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:092d21b5ddd3fc05065a39e514d248870a1fe7823459cdc1d8729e0c7c0337c4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:034756d5ed399ea343b932602a83a40909f3a7243321294e56eed25445fb969f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 34,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 34,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 34,
      "hexagramName": "大壯",
      "poemText": "節慶之德，不涉亂國。雖昧無光，民受大福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:213f4c0cfc50d95c88e73fca76dcf0f735abd5605b116b659fd712fea04f441d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:cd6304af37ebefb135d6b6e997f44e44a3fe05383f109064441ca026292a4885"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 35,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 35,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 35,
      "hexagramName": "晉",
      "poemText": "驅羊南行，與福相逢。狼驚我馬，虎盜我子。悲恨自咎。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:cfaff7f20bc4a9ced239a8f4c12235e76794d31a5a3425473d7fc99455cc151f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:49bfad093b2065c41460381f36eb308f82dea100734129f169208386376822a6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 36,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 36,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 36,
      "hexagramName": "明夷",
      "poemText": "尼父孔丘，善釣鯉魚。羅網一舉，獲利萬頭。富我家居。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:90a1125d4bacba4d0a48e47113838caf8f9facfdc372e528bcf89ea9d01264d2",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:dd26874991ca16cf03b92a9b39e9da7c4c58d065193430b28f5fa22a075ca2af"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 37,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 37,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 37,
      "hexagramName": "家人",
      "poemText": "本根不用，華葉落去，更為孤嫗。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c4fca3f3c1fa5f97aea8cb592dce85d1ea2b7cfba2a216130b2e3c6de1fdddac",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2778156e6fbd74bc9014b1aec1c6fa70d04bbd191428fafaf86a7b27c8913b36"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 38,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 38,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 38,
      "hexagramName": "睽",
      "poemText": "設罟捕魚，反得居諸。負困竭忠，伍氏夷誅。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:82de64e93d3f1e6176eb0beb4889074e6b82662786c1d5d15740de34753236ac",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:daad76f361062d86bcbdc066281b68599eaf0bdd1b56b57cef5bbd15d3abe915"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 39,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 39,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 39,
      "hexagramName": "蹇",
      "poemText": "敏捷亟疾，如猿集木。彤弓雖調，終不能獲。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:57805292326ae2f0c604f69c5fc3621bf8e67c391a19958c8b520a48a1a12bff",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a85a80b183a53c73b25d55be6c21db497e8d69c4c184c05e579471f00b3607eb"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 40,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 40,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 40,
      "hexagramName": "解",
      "poemText": "冠帶南行，與福相期。邀於嘉國，拜位逢時。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:62b7fdf0c3f3f731b42c096627cc085dbbfa052b4285067aba6670bca7a8533b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5036144118ee5d7cf4fcc128f8875dc0ec8bcaf77b6475eb62a1f582448b0825"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 41,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 41,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 41,
      "hexagramName": "損",
      "poemText": "年豐歲熟，政仁民樂，祿入獲福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9bc99f507467506fde62619711beaaa656d9966b2dd531d1237e938a472aa836",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:379cbbf9467ecf9f9a951a64acede2965355b02f2a3c8c85e39361de5c1fb821"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 42,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 42,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 42,
      "hexagramName": "益",
      "poemText": "築闕石巔，立基水源。疾病不安，老孤無鄰。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:755e99a0c3fb9755888bde1a45096d8cffa3cdf184f382050804e2f164609e60",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b3138fb30eda144c821e1fb266ab254341700c338191f184df8f26b3ee7d8085"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 43,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 43,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 43,
      "hexagramName": "夬",
      "poemText": "逐狐東山，水遏我前。深不可涉，失利後還。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6418e6c8dab7c4d1db19124e73b68400bec312333ffc93338003d80e29c97b81",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ef6e748bb461ec3401243ff14ff895d5a3b64586598d01502663c8597ca9fa22"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 44,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 44,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 44,
      "hexagramName": "姤",
      "poemText": "麟子鳳雛，生長嘉國。和氣所居，康樂溫仁。邦多聖人。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:83c44a6b32f07d3d68c5ac63de91cd9cdf9a9f274f885e7d9dc61a7618076999",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6f33c4120478c3f62edb239d996bb2a67c925c952b7b8721a04607530144babb"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 45,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 45,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 45,
      "hexagramName": "萃",
      "poemText": "西行求玉，莫得卞璞。反得凶惡，使我驚惑。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:cf62df9956a0bb09dc65331b915a0961a0c0a796ef4c236953b898d85c31a80d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7d6a402fb7fce70fa27f57b0ab8d53555c9275fd9d633839555bdab567de8437"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 46,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 46,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 46,
      "hexagramName": "升",
      "poemText": "心狂志悖，聽視聾盲。正命無常，下民多孽。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5192616444f2df03319cf04ce15b13457ed6bd7751dfb6d4c94af7f6c75b0ae3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a4802e34d75d165f4d73e60cac4d21a28f3e2aa2fbda871e18beb74997ac12d9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 47,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 47,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 47,
      "hexagramName": "困",
      "poemText": "南國少子，才略美好。求我長女，賤薄不與。反得醜惡，後乃大悔。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:dbe5e26e11cffcadb3fce2785a9b4deb5e5a595ffe7627d007eeccabf4377d91",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9c4d8488261a4bce7d864210320c617c2f4ce1b60340ab3a8ecee13d5d36b382"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 48,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 48,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 48,
      "hexagramName": "井",
      "poemText": "透迤高源，家伯妄施，亂其在官。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:298b5aa33dfed893cb9dcfaa1d9ef8e48de50f9ec2be4cd11f299311a1b2b94c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:82ec3f73575748e944dc9dd31bdcb04d09904b1de4b2c4882007014a8d9de775"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 49,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 49,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 49,
      "hexagramName": "革",
      "poemText": "謝恩拜德，東歸吾國，歡樂有福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c1635ea9ec70d96b931d9e7fba6aef5891fe9d07ce0a175ab4451dc2106b061f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:dcf5d4744646186433a7c18a4bd5ae588f0fc9be69693c4a29728f1f2e802dbe"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 50,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 50,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 50,
      "hexagramName": "鼎",
      "poemText": "雞鳴同舉，思配無家。執佩持鳧，莫使致之。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:429828403e1d3f1eab66b10de8ecb0c9ec083c6bcec36e5209c7e6a293a260ce",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2b337c7704de6438768754534c4fded0337289e8622ce97ffa600610637d76d5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 51,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 51,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 51,
      "hexagramName": "震",
      "poemText": "凶重憂慮，身受誅罪，神不能解。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:522e40c58c850ce19ce8468f6fddcc920a6aa56eb0822f178244f980676642d2",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:aeb3f264896633a7589f7103019d3f95e8cff847daa642e296443e21f40fe71b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 52,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 52,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 52,
      "hexagramName": "艮",
      "poemText": "虎豹熊羆，遊戲山谷。仁賢君子，得其所欲。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a54170ed5b764265beab4c76569e89254ea64e48ca990fa226962a7890c3f466",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9981719b361b67969224056f1559e45cb436edf9a6d2921989f239757b9d2919"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 54,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 54,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 54,
      "hexagramName": "歸妹",
      "poemText": "海隅遼右，福祿所至。柔嘉蒙祉，尤夷何咎。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:bf8df9e24f065841adb628bcd61bc25bb984881b0b177a8b4f93e4a5e2f52c86",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:37483557801bbd10e9a43964b5ba04dd02386bd2439fab1ec0782e731c1d9e72"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 55,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 55,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 55,
      "hexagramName": "豐",
      "poemText": "華首之山，仙道所遊。利以居止，長無咎憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:24fc6c044c76adcfb1922f01d14184752c33946ccc15696c5b11efbdbad691cf",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a98254538f011b88421bef93a3bd07f0e914fa887256bfe5f64ad051be4ea95e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 56,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 56,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 56,
      "hexagramName": "旅",
      "poemText": "甲乙戊庚，隨時轉行。不失常節，萌芽律屈。咸達生出，各順其類。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:be9f967da38ebdf09da54879c6458d62541f4f7e715c0039719a05937b9d4ad8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:daafe44dcc6782034ebc79e278620288423fcce40e433a66be5a3e4848b3b570"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 57,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 57,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 57,
      "hexagramName": "巽",
      "poemText": "跂躓未起，失利後市，不得鹿子。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:90fad8d1b3f15bd0209eefd870f0dfade82d43a148b61c58f912f31342bef190",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d283fc629f625085700413d0b45ec9ac1656968803cd1a28ae60e0b792dcc8db"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 58,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 58,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 58,
      "hexagramName": "兌",
      "poemText": "惟恃自負，不志於下。血從地出，誅罰失理。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:55e70cab7a52c2238f36dcf0c7c3fbcc802f351817634e8885e7a370a7e83746",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:fdd6a54a3f24f85300ae17dda87920b9eb569c38d93a96c32699c7dec275385b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 59,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 59,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 59,
      "hexagramName": "渙",
      "poemText": "江河淮海，天之都市。商人受福，國家饒有。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5237b8aebb506195845c48459bde5ad78e7f64656227f107fe2be98b2db8cd95",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:45dd4be15dddaaf2655abe7801653f8fcee04a381794e95b77257db88e9c8632"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 60,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 60,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 60,
      "hexagramName": "節",
      "poemText": "節情省慾，賦斂有度。家給人足，且貴且富。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b76a879624e9e371d7bd8cb652bfff0ff3b8d09ea04275209761d8cc0701d43d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:eb6586bb88c2ddec0525212930e608025922f7ea3c3cca382666ef6366cb247a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 61,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 61,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 61,
      "hexagramName": "中孚",
      "poemText": "牝馬鳴呴，求呼其潦。雲雨大會，流成河海。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4ae95e06509567aebf2ce352c40f40501192c708f9254ac8ba3a4ab2984e7743",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6bff192632985e4e3ef583826e88b215299e60f152008c45dcf78815ca40903b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 62,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 62,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 62,
      "hexagramName": "小過",
      "poemText": "日月之塗，所行必到，無有患故。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d8de7b2c0100aef53cc3fc2dc91ef7dc139ebb8d1d5d8a86bcec58ab0ea30eae",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c6419f630cd2584b4b55f254d760b37e090d40783f0082c992513bfb49b5ebf8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 63,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 63,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 63,
      "hexagramName": "既濟",
      "poemText": "乘風而舉，與飛鳥俱。一舉千里，見吾愛母。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0290e203f35a18a1e29aaebf8fd29b8b52fa6cb9a91763c7287f616be09fe361",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1874f1bc1141236d0e66c40b5f32ee7c98c72132935f75c3479bb04fb7a00108"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 53,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 64,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 64,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 64,
      "hexagramName": "未濟",
      "poemText": "陰配陽事，臥木反立。君子攸行，喪其官職。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2a3d130596b092a6f5f5b805e6218338879a65e315f5b92fba8e3ae6a32210c0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4651e84cece7239e832514b112055d3d1ed674b97455d7c088ec3481826f41cb"
    }
  ]
}
